        "created_at": "2014-02-13T23:26:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"torian\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/919ad9/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> torian:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>For the record, the Leauge of Loser's was a marvel comics team from around the mid 2000s. I think they are just going for the obscure reference.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>And suddenly everything makes sense.</p>",
