        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-14T14:21:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Amnachaidh wrote:</b><br><blockquote>We all liked SotM before it was cool. Great. We're Hipsters now.  :grin:  Congrats to &gt;G. I hope that this makes for logistical issues for you from the orders pouring in.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;I was a hipster before it was cool.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You can always tell a Hipster by the blisters on their tongues. They are always trying to eat that pizza before its cool</p>",
